                      PCIM-DAS1602/16 Version 2.0
                      ---------------------------

 Linux loadable module for the Measurement Computing PCIM-DAS1602/16 and PCIe-DAS1602/16 adapters
 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Introduction:
-------------
This driver was written by Warren J. Jasper at North Carolina State University.
Some updates and modifications have been added by Trev Jackson <trev.g7pvs@ntlworld.com>
It is a driver for the Measurement Computing PCIM-DAS1602/16 and
PCIe-DAS1602/16 adapters. It should run on all Linux  2.6.29 or later kernels on
Pentium machines.  With minor modification, it should run on other architectures.
Tested as working on Debian 13 (kernel version 6.12.115) with a pair of
PCIe-DAS1602/16 adapters in Dell Optiplex 3050 (Intel Core i5-7500).

Please send comments and bug fixes to wjasper@ncsu.edu.  The source
for the driver is located at https://github.com/wjasper/Linux_Drivers

